*% === Options and Constraints =========
*OpenGroup: InstallableOptions/Options Installed
*OpenUI *InstalledMemory/Memory Configuration : PickOne
*DefaultInstalledMemory: 64MB
*InstalledMemory 64MB: ""
*InstalledMemory 128MB: ""
*InstalledMemory 192MB: ""
*InstalledMemory 320MB: ""
*?InstalledMemory: "
	save
	(Unknown) currentsystemparams /RamSize get
	dup 67108864 eq{exch pop (64MB) exch}if
	dup 134217728 eq{exch pop (128MB) exch}if
	dup 201326592 eq{exch pop (192MB) exch}if
	dup 335544320 eq{exch pop (320MB) exch}if
	pop = flush
	restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *InstalledMemory

*OpenUI *BROption_Disk/Hard Disk: Boolean
*DefaultBROption_Disk: False/Not Installed
*BROption_Disk False/Not Installed: ""
*BROption_Disk True/Installed: ""
*?BROption_Disk: "
  save false
   (%disk?%)
   { currentdevparams dup /Writeable known
      { /Writeable get {pop true} if }  { pop } ifelse
    } 10 string /IODevice resourceforall
    {(True)}{(False)} ifelse = flush
  restore"
*End
*CloseUI: *BROption_Disk

*OpenUI *BROption_Tray/Option Sheet Feeder : Boolean
*DefaultBROption_Tray: False/Not Installed
*BROption_Tray False/Not Installed: ""
*BROption_Tray True/2-Tray Module: ""
*?BROption_Tray: "
	save
	currentpagedevice /InputAttributes get dup null eq
	{pop (Unknown)}
	{2 known {(True)} {(False)} ifelse} ifelse = flush
	restore"
*End
*CloseUI: *BROption_Tray

*CloseGroup: InstallableOptions

