*% ===== MediaType =========================================
*OpenUI *MediaType/Custom Page Paper qualities:  PickOne
*OrderDependency: 90.0 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain1
*MediaType Plain1/Plain Paper 1 (60-75g/m2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (plain1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Plain2/Plain Paper 2 (76-99g/m2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (plain2) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Transparency/Transparency: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (transparency) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy1/Thick Paper 1 (100-159g/m2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (heavy1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy2/Thick Paper 1 - Side 2: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (heavy2) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy3/Thick Paper 2 (160-216g/m2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (heavy3) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy4/Thick Paper 2 - Side 2: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (heavy4) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Gloss1/Glossy Paper: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (gloss1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Gloss2/Glossy Paper (Side 2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (gloss2) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Label/Label: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (label) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Postcard1/Card: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (postcard1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Postcard2/Card (Side 2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (postcard2) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Envelope1/Envelope: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (envelope1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Envelope2/Envelope (Side 2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (envelope2) put setpagedevice"
*?MediaType: "
save
    currentpagedevice /MediaClass get dup null eq {pop (Plain1)}
    { dup (plain2) eq {pop (Plain2)}
     { dup (transparency) eq {pop (Transparency)}
      { dup (heavy1) eq {pop (Heavy1)}
       {dup (heavy2) eq{pop (Heavy2)}
        {dup (heavy3) eq{pop (Heavy3)}
         {dup (heavy4) eq {pop (Heavy4)}
          {dup (gloss1) eq {pop (Gloss1)}
           {dup (gloss2) eq {pop (Gloss2)}
            {dup (label) eq {pop (Label)}
             {dup (postcard1) eq {pop (Postcard1)}
              {dup (postcard2) eq {pop (Postcard2)}
               {dup (envelope1) eq {pop (Envelope1)}
                {dup (envelope2) eq {pop (Envelope2)}
                 {(Unknown)} ifelse
                } ifelse 
               } ifelse 
              } ifelse 
             } ifelse 
            } ifelse 
           } ifelse
          } ifelse
         } ifelse
        } ifelse
       } ifelse
      } ifelse
     } ifelse
    } ifelse
   = flush
restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*% InputSlot Information ================
*RequiresPageRegion All: True
*OpenUI *InputSlot: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20.0 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: UpperSheetFeeder
*InputSlot AutoFeed2/Auto (Include Manual): "
  1 dict dup /TraySwitch true put setpagedevice
  1 dict dup /ManualFeed true put setpagedevice
  /FXProcs /ProcSet resourcestatus {
  	/FXProcs /ProcSet findresource /autofeed2 get true exch exec
  } if pop pop"
*End
*InputSlot UpperSheetFeeder/Tray1: "
  currentpagedevice /InputAttributes get dup 1 known 
  {0 get dup null eq 
   { pop } 
   { dup length 1 add dict copy 
     dup /InputAttributes
     1 dict dup /Priority [0 1 2] put
     put setpagedevice
   } ifelse }
  {pop}
  ifelse
  1 dict dup /TraySwitch false put setpagedevice"
*End
*InputSlot MiddleSheetFeeder/Tray2: "
  currentpagedevice /InputAttributes get dup 1 known 
  {1 get dup null eq 
   { pop } 
   { dup length 1 add dict copy 
     dup /InputAttributes
     1 dict dup /Priority [1 0 2] put
     put setpagedevice
   } ifelse }
  {pop}
  ifelse
  1 dict dup /TraySwitch false put setpagedevice"
*End
*InputSlot LowerSheetFeeder/Tray3: "
  currentpagedevice /InputAttributes get dup 1 known 
  {1 get dup null eq 
   { pop } 
   { dup length 1 add dict copy 
     dup /InputAttributes
     1 dict dup /Priority [2 0 1] put
     put setpagedevice
   } ifelse }
  {pop}
  ifelse
  1 dict dup /TraySwitch false put setpagedevice"
*End
*?InputSlot: "
  save
  2 dict
  dup /0 (UpperSheetFeeder) put
  dup /1 (MiddleSheetFeeder) put
  dup /2 (LowerSheetFeeder) put
  currentpagedevice /InputAttributes get
  dup /Priority known
  { /Priority get 0 get (      ) cvs cvn get }
  {
    dup length 1 eq
    { {pop} forall (       ) cvs cvn get }
    { pop pop (Unknown) } ifelse
  } ifelse
  = flush
restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *ManualFeed/MP Tray:  Boolean
*OrderDependency: 25.0 AnySetup *ManualFeed
*DefaultManualFeed: False
*ManualFeed True: "1 dict dup /ManualFeed true put setpagedevice"
*ManualFeed False: "1 dict dup /ManualFeed false put setpagedevice"
*?ManualFeed: "
  save
    currentpagedevice /ManualFeed get
    {(True)}{(False)}ifelse = flush
  restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *ManualFeed

*% Paper Handling ===================
*LandscapeOrientation: Any
*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30.0 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [595 842] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize A5: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [420 595] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize B5: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [516 729] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize BRPostcard/Card: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [283 420] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize Letter: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [612 792] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize Legal: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [612 1008] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize Env10/Com-10: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [297 684] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Monarch: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [279 540] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize EnvC5/C5: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [459 649] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize EnvDL/DL: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [312 624] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*PageSize Executive: "
    2 dict dup /PageSize [522 756] put dup /ImagingBBox null put setpagedevice"
*End
*?PageSize: "
 save
   currentpagedevice /PageSize get aload pop
   2 copy gt {exch} if 
   (Unknown) 
  11 dict
   dup [595 842] (A4) put
   dup [420 595] (A5) put
   dup [516 729] (B5) put
   dup [283 420] (BRPostcard) put
   dup [612 792] (Letter) put
   dup [612 1008] (Legal) put
   dup [297 684] (Env10) put
   dup [279 540] (EnvMonarch) put
   dup [459 649] (EnvC5) put
   dup [312 624] (EnvDL) put
   dup [522 756] (Executive) put
 { exch aload pop 4 index sub abs 5 le exch 
   5 index sub abs 5 le and 
      {exch pop exit} {pop} ifelse
   } bind forall
   = flush pop pop
restore 
"
*End
*CloseUI: *PageSize

