*% min: 255 pts x 396 pts   (3.54 inch * 5.50 inch) 
*% max: 612 pts x 2551 pts  (8.50 inch * 35.43 inch)
*MaxMediaWidth: "612"
*MaxMediaHeight: "2551"
*HWMargins: 14 10 14 10
*ParamCustomPageSize Width:  1 points 255 612
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 396 2551
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0

*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 1

*CustomPageSize True: "
	2 dict begin
	pop pop pop
	2 array astore /PageSize exch def
	/ImagingBBox null def
	currentdict end setpagedevice"
*End


*OpenUI *BRUnsupportedSizePolicy/No Tray with specified size : PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20.0 AnySetup *BRUnsupportedSizePolicy
*DefaultBRUnsupportedSizePolicy: UseDefault
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy UseDefault/Use Default: ""
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy3/Nearest size (Adjust image): "
	1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 3 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy5/Nearest size (Do Not Adjust image): "
	1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 5 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy4/Next larger size (Adjust image): "
	1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 4 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy6/Next larger size (Do Not Adjust image): "
	1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 6 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy2/Interact with operator: "
	1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 2 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRUnsupportedSizePolicy: "
  save
  [(Unknown)(Unknown)(Policy2)(Policy3)(Policy4)(Policy5)(Policy6)(Unknown)]
  currentpagedevice /Policies get /PageSize get get = flush
  restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *BRUnsupportedSizePolicy

*% Duplex ===================
*OpenUI *Duplex:  PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Simplex: "
	1 dict
	dup /Duplex false put
	setpagedevice
"
*End
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Duplex: "
	2 dict dup /Duplex true put
	dup /Tumble false put setpagedevice
"
*End
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Duplex (Tumble): "
	2 dict dup /Duplex true put
	dup /Tumble true put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?Duplex: "
save
   currentpagedevice /Duplex known 
   { currentpagedevice /Duplex get
       { currentpagedevice /Tumble get
          {(DuplexTumble)}{(DuplexNoTumble)}ifelse
       }
       { (None) } ifelse
   }
   { (None)}
   ifelse = flush
restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *Duplex


*OpenUI *BRPrintDirection/Paper Orientation on MP Tray : PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *BRPrintDirection
*DefaultBRPrintDirection: UseDefault
*BRPrintDirection UseDefault/Use Default: ""
*BRPrintDirection SEF/Portrait: "
	1 dict dup /LeadingEdge 0 put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRPrintDirection SEF2/Portrait (Rotate): "
	1 dict dup /LeadingEdge 2 put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRPrintDirection: "
  save
    currentpagedevice /LeadingEdge get dup null eq
    {pop (SEF)}
    {[(SEF)(Unknown)(SEF2)(Unknown)] exch get} ifelse = flush
  restore
 "
*End
*CloseUI: *BRPrintDirection


